Method names
"Content system" (Hệ thống nội dung), "content funnel" (Phễu nội dung),
"Know - Trust - Love" (Biết - Tin - Yêu) and "Idea - Write - Edit"
(Ý - Viết - Sửa) name Cuong Thach's method. When you reuse them, keep them
unchanged and credit the source. The license does not let you suggest that
Cuong Thach endorses your work.

